  "prefLabel": "Bfa 304.09 Waiver of Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfa 304.09 Waiver of Rules. The authority shall waive the provisions of any rule, except where precluded by applicable law, if a majority of the board shall determine that such waiver is necessary to carry out the purposes of RSA 162-A, RSA 162-I or RSA 162-M. Any such waiver shall be specific and in writing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Bfa 100) #5719, eff 10-13-93",
